python-eventdispatch (0.3.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  Breaking: the learning surface is rebuilt on recording.
  TrainingEvent is replaced by RecordingEvent, a sibling of SimEvent
  (both now ClockedEvent). TrainingDispatch is replaced by
  SimClockRecordingDispatch; new WallClockRecordingDispatch records
  on the wall clock. The recordings field (key "recordings",
  RecordingLog) replaces the completions field. Preemption is
  recorded (PREEMPTED, on_preempt hook). Clock settling is refused
  when step_world() drives an engine. Aliases LearningEvent /
  LearningDispatch are removed.

 -- Charlie Yan <cyanatg@gmail.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:30:00 +0000

